    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Eternal Damnation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nAs long as its _soul chain_ remains intact, the accursed forge-spurned can't be truly destroyed and rises again fully healed at the next sundown, even if its physical body was destroyed. Information about soul chains appears on page 83."
            },
            "id": "69e17ebf-ffeb-432b-b486-b83c6d2407d6",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:01.890868"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Searing Heat"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(fire)\n\nA creature that touches the accursed forge-spurned (including grappling it or hitting it with an unarmed attack) takes 4d6 fire damage (33 basic Reflex save)."
            },
            "id": "7396ddfa-fcd7-4e90-b0f4-ffcb1fa97c1a",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:01.890868"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Soul Chain"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, fire, necromancy)\n\nIf a creature is slain by an attack from the _soul chain_ and the accursed forge-spurned is able to retain the creature's corpse, it can bind the creature's soul into the _soul chain_ (as bind soul) with a day of work at a forge and a 20 Crafting check. An individual whose soul is bound in this way can't be resurrected unless the _soul chain_ is destroyed (Hardness 10, 40 HP, BT 20)."
            },
            "id": "60d3e5b2-9344-4334-8539-ba59ba4476bb",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:01.890868"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Soul Siphon"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nWhen the accursed forge-spurned critically hits a target with its _soul chain_, the chain leeches away a portion of the target's soul. The target must attempt a 36 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target is drained 1.\n- **Failure:** The target is drained 2.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is drained 2 and stunned 2 from the pain."
            },
            "id": "5970db72-2632-4713-a282-7aec07b33800",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:01.890868"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
