            "action_name": {
              "value": "Inflate Bellows"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The accursed forge-spurned has used Forge Breath.\n\nThe accursed forge-spurned re-inflates its flaccid lungs, enabling it to use Forge Breath again."
