        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Forge Breath"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, evocation, fire)\n\nThe accursed forge-spurned breathes a cloud of stinging soot, ash, and glowing embers. This can affect either a 30-foot cone or a 20-foot burst centered on the accursed forge-spurned and persists for 1d4 rounds. Creatures that move into or start their turn in the area take 12d6 fire damage (36 basic Reflex save). A creature that fails its save is also blinded for 1 minute. Creatures within the cloud are concealed, though not from the accursed forge-spurned. The accursed forge-spurned can't use Forge Breath again until it has used Inflate Bellows."
            },
